WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.464
Communication includes a sender, message, medium, receiver and feedback, but successful understanding also depends on context.

00:00:07.464 --> 00:00:12.596
Active listening means checking meaning rather than merely waiting to speak.

00:00:12.596 --> 00:00:18.660
In technical work, ambiguity can cause incorrect implementations even when everyone is cooperative.

00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:24.882
For example: “The login page opens, but submitting my school account displays ‘access denied’.

00:00:24.882 --> 00:00:26.747
I expected the notes library.

00:00:26.747 --> 00:00:32.715
The problem began after my role changed.” This narrows the stage and avoids guessing a cause.

00:00:33.715 --> 00:00:36.623
Which response demonstrates active listening?

00:00:36.623 --> 00:00:40.695
Restatement and confirmation help establish shared understanding.
